<section class="public-page hidden legal-page" id="privacyPublic"><div class="about-intro"><div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</div><h1>Privacy <span class="gradient-text">notice</span></h1><p class="muted">How NovaMine handles information used by your workspace.</p></div><article class="glass legal-card"><p><b>Last updated: November 3, 2026</b></p><h2>Information in NovaMine</h2><p>NovaMine stores account details such as your name and email address, workspace preferences, search criteria, candidate records returned by configured data sources, shortlists, and activity needed to operate your account.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to authenticate you, run and display searches, save workspace records, provide exports, and maintain the service. Search criteria may be sent to the data providers configured for your workspace, including Tavily or People Data Labs. Their use of that information is governed by their own terms and privacy notices.</p><h2>Sign-in providers and hosting</h2><p>If you choose Google or LinkedIn sign-in, NovaMine receives the profile and email details the provider makes available to complete sign-in. The application is hosted by Render, and account and workspace information is stored in its configured database.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can stop using the service at any time. To ask about, correct, or request removal of account information, contact <a href="mailto:labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com"><svg class="mail-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6.5h17v11h-17z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com</a>. NovaMine does not claim that search results are complete or independently verified.</p></article></section>
<section class="public-page hidden legal-page" id="termsPublic"><div class="about-intro"><div class="eyebrow">TERMS</div><h1>Terms and <span class="gradient-text">conditions</span></h1><p class="muted">Rules for using NovaMine.</p></div><article class="glass legal-card"><p><b>Last updated: November 3, 2026</b></p><h2>Use of the service</h2><p>Use NovaMine only for lawful data discovery and in accordance with the terms of any connected data provider. Do not use it to access data without authorization, violate privacy rights, send unsolicited messages, or make decisions about people using inaccurate or unlawfully obtained information.</p><h2>Data and search results</h2><p>Search results may be incomplete, outdated, or inaccurate. You are responsible for reviewing records and ensuring your use of candidate data complies with applicable laws and provider restrictions. NovaMine is a research and workflow tool and does not make hiring or eligibility decisions.</p><h2>Accounts and availability</h2><p>Keep your sign-in credentials secure and provide accurate account information. Features depend on configured providers and may change as the service evolves. NovaMine is provided without a guarantee that every data source or result will always be available or accurate.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com"><svg class="mail-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6.5h17v11h-17z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com</a>.</p></article></section>
