<section class="page active" id="overview"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE DASHBOARD</div><h1>Welcome back, <span id="welcomeName">Labique</span></h1><p>Your data discovery workspace at a glance.</p></div><button class="btn" onclick="goApp('mineAnalytics')">✧ Start mining</button></div><div class="cards stat-grid"><div class="glass stat"><span class="iconbox">▦</span><label>Total records</label><strong>0</strong><div class="trend">Loading workspace data…</div></div><div class="glass stat"><span class="iconbox">◈</span><label>Companies mined</label><strong>0</strong><div class="trend">Loading workspace data…</div></div><div class="glass stat"><span class="iconbox">◎</span><label>Industries</label><strong>0</strong><div class="trend">Loading workspace data…</div></div><div class="glass stat"><span class="iconbox">◉</span><label>Countries</label><strong>0</strong><div class="trend">Loading workspace data…</div></div></div><div class="cards two-col"><div class="glass"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Mining activity</h3><div class="sub">Candidate records added over the last 14 days</div></div><span class="badge purple">LIVE</span></div><div class="chartbox"><div class="sub" style="padding:48px 12px;text-align:center">Candidate acquisition appears here after your first search.</div></div></div><div class="glass"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Recent activity</h3><div class="sub">Example events · demo data</div></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-row"><span class="activity-icon">✦</span><div><b>Workspace activity</b><small>Sign in to view recent mining activity.</small></div></div></div></div></div><div class="glass table-card overview-records-card"><div class="card-head dashboard-records-head"><div><h3>Recent mining records</h3><div class="sub">A quick look at the latest data records</div></div><button class="btn outline dashboard-view-results" onclick="goApp('resultSet')">View result set <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div class="table-scroll" style="max-height:270px"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>COMPANY</th><th>COUNTRY</th><th>INDUSTRY</th><th>WEBSITE</th><th>STATUS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="overviewRows"></tbody></table></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="mineAnalytics"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DATA MINING CONFIGURATION</div><h1>Start Mining</h1><p>Choose your target market, industry and data points.</p></div><span class="badge purple">Discovery studio</span></div><div class="cards two-col"><div class="glass form-card"><h3 style="font-size:13px;margin:0 0 15px;color:#d0aaff">① Search criteria</h3><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Job role</label><select id="jobRole"></select></div><div class="field"><label for="country">Country / Location</label><select id="country"></select></div><div class="field"><label for="industry">Industry sector</label><select id="industry"></select></div><div class="field"><label for="keywords">Company size</label><select><option>Any size</option><option>1–50 employees</option><option>51–250 employees</option><option>251–1,000 employees</option><option>1,001+ employees</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Keywords</label><input id="keywords" placeholder="e.g. cloud services, software development"/></div></div><h3 style="font-size:13px;margin:22px 0 5px;color:#d0aaff">② Data points to include</h3><div class="check-grid"><label class="option"><input checked="" type="checkbox"/> Company profile</label><label class="option"><input checked="" type="checkbox"/> Website</label><label class="option"><input checked="" type="checkbox"/> LinkedIn URL</label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox"/> Email address</label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox"/> Phone number</label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox"/> Revenue estimate</label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox"/> Company size</label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox"/> Funding information</label></div></div><div class="glass" style="padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 38%,#8d3ee833,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(145deg,#21153d99,#0c132a99)"><div class="orb" style="width:210px;height:210px"><div class="cube" style="width:88px;height:88px;font-size:32px">▤</div></div><h3 style="font-size:15px;color:#d4adff;margin:24px 0 5px">Data discovery engine</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;max-width:260px">This interactive preview simulates a mining run. It does not contact external data sources or collect live company data.</p></div></div><div class="glass mining-bottom"><div><span class="muted" style="font-size:10px">Selected data points</span><strong id="pointCount" style="font-size:22px;color:#d3a7ff;margin-left:12px">6</strong></div><button class="btn" id="startMining">🚀 Start Mining</button></div><div class="glass" id="miningProgress" style="display:none;padding:17px;margin-top:13px"><b id="miningTitle" style="font-size:12px">Mining in progress</b><span id="miningPercent" style="float:right;color:#d0a4ff;font-size:11px">0%</span><div style="height:6px;background:#34304d;border-radius:8px;margin-top:14px;overflow:hidden"><i id="miningBar" style="display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d3a0ff,#7434d0);transition:.3s"></i></div><p class="sub" id="miningText">Preparing criteria…</p></div></section>
<section class="page" id="resultSet"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DATA MINING RECORDS</div><h1>Result Set</h1><p>Browse the included sample records. This preview does not connect to a live data source.</p></div><button class="btn outline" onclick="exportRows()">⇩ Export CSV</button></div><div class="metric-cards"><div class="glass metric"><b>15 / 15</b><span>Sample companies in this preview</span></div><div class="glass metric"><b>3</b><span>Example search filters</span></div><div class="glass metric"><b>Demo</b><span>Sample mining session</span></div><div class="glass metric"><b id="recordsCount">10</b><span>Records in this demo dataset</span></div></div><div class="glass table-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Mining records</h3><div class="sub">Search and navigate through generated records</div></div><div class="table-tools"><input class="searchbox" id="recordSearch" placeholder="Search records…"/></div></div><div class="table-scroll" style="max-height:440px"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>COMPANY NAME</th><th>COUNTRY</th><th>INDUSTRY</th><th>WEBSITE</th><th>EMAIL</th><th>STATUS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="recordRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="pagination"><span id="pageSummary">Showing 1–10 of 50 records</span><div class="pages"><button id="prevPage">‹</button><span id="pageNumbers"></span><button id="nextPage">›</button></div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="result"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESULT DETAILS</div><h1>Result</h1><p>Inspect a selected record and its available company information.</p></div><button class="btn outline" onclick="goApp('resultSet')">← Back to result set</button></div><div class="glass" id="resultDetail" style="padding:22px"><div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">Select a company from the Result Set table to view its details here.</div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="profile"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT</div><h1>Profile</h1><p>View your account information.</p></div></div><div class="glass profile-card"><div class="profile-summary"><div class="big-avatar" id="profileInitial">LS</div><h3 id="profileName">Labique Shaikh</h3><p>NovaMine member</p><span class="badge">Active account</span></div><div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="profileNameInput">Full name</label><input id="profileNameInput" readonly=""/></div><div class="field"><label for="profileEmailInput">Email address</label><input id="profileEmailInput" readonly=""/></div><div class="field"><label>Account role</label><input readonly="" value="Workspace user"/></div><div class="field"><label>Member since</label><input readonly="" value="Today"/></div></div><p class="sub" style="margin-top:18px">Your account details are managed securely by NovaMine.</p><div class="glass password-reset-card"><div><div class="eyebrow">PASSWORD &amp; SECURITY</div><h2>Reset your password</h2><p>We’ll email a secure reset link to <b id="profileResetEmail">your account email</b>.</p></div><button class="btn outline" id="profilePasswordReset" type="button">Send reset link</button></div><div class="glass admin-access-card hidden" id="adminAccessCard"><div class="admin-access-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</div><h2>Admin dashboard</h2><p>Review registered accounts, mining runs and candidate totals.</p></div></div><form id="adminUnlockForm" class="admin-unlock-form" novalidate><label class="field"><span>Admin password</span><input id="adminPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="255" required placeholder="Enter admin password"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Unlock admin dashboard</button><div class="error" id="adminPasswordError"></div></form><div class="hidden" id="adminDashboard"><div class="admin-dashboard-heading"><div><h3>Account overview</h3><p class="sub">User, mining and recent presence times. Offline is marked after 90 seconds without a heartbeat.</p></div><button class="btn outline" id="adminLock" type="button">Lock dashboard</button></div><div class="admin-metrics"><div class="glass admin-metric"><b id="adminTotalUsers">0</b><span>Total users</span></div><div class="glass admin-metric"><b id="adminActiveUsers">0</b><span>Active users</span></div><div class="glass admin-metric"><b id="adminDeactivatedUsers">0</b><span>Deactivated</span></div><div class="glass admin-metric"><b id="adminMiningRuns">0</b><span>Mining runs</span></div><div class="glass admin-metric"><b id="adminCandidateTotal">0</b><span>Candidates mined</span></div></div><div class="table-scroll admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>USER</th><th>MINING RUNS</th><th>CANDIDATES</th><th>LAST SIGN-IN</th><th>PRESENCE / LAST SEEN</th><th>OFFLINE SINCE</th><th>ACCOUNT STATUS</th><th>ACTIONS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="adminUserRows"><tr><td colspan="9">Unlock to load users.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="settings"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">PREFERENCES</div><h1>Settings</h1><p>Manage your NovaMine workspace preferences.</p></div></div><div class="settings-grid"><div class="glass form-card"><h3 style="font-size:12px;margin:0 0 10px">Application preferences</h3><div class="setting-row">Dark glass appearance <input checked="" class="toggle" type="checkbox"/></div><div class="setting-row">Mining completion notifications <input checked="" class="toggle" type="checkbox"/></div><div class="setting-row">Email updates <input class="toggle" type="checkbox"/></div><div class="setting-row">Compact tables <input class="toggle" type="checkbox"/></div><button class="btn" onclick="toast('Preferences saved')" style="margin-top:15px">Save preferences</button></div><div class="glass form-card"><h3 style="font-size:12px;margin:0 0 10px">Security &amp; account</h3><div class="setting-row">Account status <span class="badge">Active</span></div><div class="setting-row">Email verification <span class="badge">Demo verified</span></div><div class="setting-row">Session <span class="muted">This browser</span></div><button class="btn outline" onclick="logout()" style="margin-top:15px">Log out</button></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="about"><div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT NOVAMINE</div><h1>About Us</h1><p>Purpose-built data discovery and mining workspace.</p></div></div><div class="glass about-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</div><h2>Make data more <span class="gradient-text">useful and accessible.</span></h2><p>NovaMine brings data mining configuration, records, results and analytics into one organised workspace. The interface is designed to make each step easier to understand and manage.</p></div><div class="hero-art" style="height:230px"><div class="orb" style="width:210px;height:210px"><div class="cube" style="width:85px;height:85px">✧</div></div></div></div><div class="cards feature-cards"><article class="glass feature-card"><strong>Smart discovery</strong><p>Filter by role, country, industry and keywords.</p></article><article class="glass feature-card"><strong>Organised records</strong><p>Review previously generated records in a paginated table.</p></article><article class="glass feature-card"><strong>Useful analytics</strong><p>Understand mining progress and record distribution.</p></article></div><div class="glass contact-card dashboard-contact"><div class="contact-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3.5 6.5h17v11h-17z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg></div><div class="contact-copy"><div class="eyebrow">CONTACT US</div><h2>Talk to Labique</h2><p>Questions, feedback, or collaboration ideas? Get in touch.</p><div class="contact-actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com"><svg class="mail-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6.5h17v11h-17z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>labiqueshaikh470@gmail.com</a><a class="btn outline" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/labique-shaikh-79169b289" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
</main></div></div>
